sequenceDiagram
    actor Ops as Régisseur
    participant UI as Festival Control
    participant API as Schedule API
    participant Service as ScheduleService
    participant State as Festival State

    Ops->>UI: propose un nouveau créneau
    UI->>API: POST /api/shows
    API->>Service: scheduleShow(show)
    Service->>State: vérifier scène disponible
    Service->>State: vérifier artiste disponible
    alt Aucun conflit
      Service->>State: enregistrer le show
      Service-->>API: CREATED
      API-->>UI: 201 Created
    else Conflit métier
      Service-->>API: STAGE_CONFLICT / ARTIST_CONFLICT
      API-->>UI: 409 Conflict
    end
